        "original_id": "5f341156-33f3-5ea8-a687-7e9a4b4dd941",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stieber Twins, GZA, Curse, Prodigal Sunn\n- Topics: graffiti, hip hop\n- Works: Ich Lebe Für Hip Hop\n- Roles: graffiti artists, breakdancers, rappers, hip hop producers, DJs\n- Places/Periods: Ancient Egypt, Ancient Greece, Roman Empire\n\nFacts:\n- Graffiti have existed since ancient times, with examples dating back to Ancient Egypt, Ancient Greece, and the Roman Empire.\n- Graffiti range from simple written words to elaborate wall paintings.\n- The Stieber Twins are known as graffiti artists, breakdancers, rappers, hip hop producers, and DJs.\n- The song \"Ich Lebe Für Hip Hop\" features GZA, Curse, Prodigal Sunn, and the Stieber Twins.",
